        <mxCell id="dgsQsbLf-sttDytlrIba-59" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;rounded=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;A Tenant is a portal: a set of Organizations sharing one sidebar group, its pages and its tenant.&amp;lt;code&amp;gt;.* permissions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="184" x="-2651" y="-540" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dgsQsbLf-sttDytlrIba-61" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#CCE5FF;strokeColor=#d79b00;rounded=0;align=left;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;An Organization belongs to at most one Tenant. A User belongs to exactly one Organization and holds exactly one Access Profile. An Organization can have 0-n Access Profiles bound to it; profiles bound to no Organization are global.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7px; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Branding (logo, accent) belongs to the Organization, not the Tenant.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="184" x="-2435" y="-540" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dgsQsbLf-sttDytlrIba-69" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;An access profile may be bound to one organization, in which case only that organization&#39;s users may hold it. Each user is assigned exactly one access profile by an admin, whose own rank caps what they can hand out.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="190" x="-2219" y="-540" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
